description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thefarside.com/2026/08/11/0</guid><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 08:05:00 -0400</pubDate></item><item><title>The Far Side - 2026-08-10 #5</title><link>https://www.thefarside.com/2026/08/10/4</link><description>&lt;div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://comiccaster.xyz/.netlify/functions/proxy-farside-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffeatureassets.amuniversal.com%2Fassets%2F33dac590d8ba0137c959005056a9545d" alt="The Far Side comic" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;"&gt;“Don’t listen to him, George. He didn’t
